  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roast the poblano peppers in the oven for 20 minutes.",
    "Let the peppers cool down, then peel off the skin and remove the seeds.",
    "In a pan, heat the oil and saute the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "In a bowl, mix the cooked quinoa, palm sugar, nam tan pip, salt, and pepper.",
    "Stuff each pepper with the quinoa mixture and place in a Korean brass bowl.",
    "Deglaze the pan with a little water and pour the sauce over the peppers.",
    "Bake the peppers in the oven for 15 minutes.",
    "Serve the chiles rellenos hot, garnished with fresh herbs."
